      "value": "<p>This is a feature added onto characters to enable various rules adjustments and changes, as described in @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.journals.rN7GRW2OrOZmmzr3]{Immortal Ardor Features &amp; Rules Adjustments}.</p><p>This feature specifically causes changes in how non-feat actions work. Removing this feature returns non-feat actions to how they would work by default.</p>"
